{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpev2A3XCA1uvo4N5Wpy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Decision: DR-9109 (Acme Manufacturing, NS-EDGE, 12%)\n\nI'll work through the approval procedure for this request.\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. Request identification**\n- ID: DR-9109\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / ERP C-1001)\n- Product: NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package, SKU NS-EDGE, list price $85,000)\n- Requested discount: 12.0% ($10,200)\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive, sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- Stated basis: \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\"\n\n**2. Active contract on request date**\nYes: ACME-MFG-2025 is active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31 and covers NS-EDGE.\n\n**3. Pricing exception for NS-EDGE**\nNo. Registered exceptions are:\n- EXC-ACME-NS500-15: NS-500 only (up to 15%)\n- EXC-ACME-NS500-10: NS-500 only (up to 10%)\n\nNeither covers NS-EDGE.\n\n**4. Contract terms for NS-EDGE**\nACME-MFG-2025 Section 3 establishes:\n- **NS-500 only:** \"eligible for discounts of up to 15%\" (per Schedule B, EXC-ACME-NS500-15)\n- **NS-EDGE and NS-CLOUD:** Section 3.1 applies: \"Prices are Northstar's current list prices less any discount **agreed in an Order**\"\n\nNo specific discount is agreed in the contract for NS-EDGE.\n\n**5. Policy in force**\nPRICING-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31):\n- Enterprise Account Executive authority: up to 10%\n- VP Sales authority: over 10% and up to 20%\n- CRO authority: over 20%\n\n**6. Requestor's authority**\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive, authorized up to 10%. A 12% discount exceeds her authority and would require VP Sales approval (Michael Torres).\n\n**7. Commercial eligibility issue**\nThe critical problem: **The request relies on the Acme Master Supply Agreement but that contract does not establish a pricing basis for a 12% discount on NS-EDGE.** The contract specifies 15% maximum for NS-500 only; for NS-EDGE, only standard list pricing applies unless a discount is separately agreed. No such agreement is documented.\n\nThe requestor is citing the contract, but special terms (15% on NS-500) do not transfer to NS-EDGE. This requires commercial review to establish whether the discount is justified under new or amended terms.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9109\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package)\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"12.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"ACME-MFG-2025 establishes specific pricing only for NS-500 (up to 15% under Schedule B/EXC-ACME-NS500-15). For NS-EDGE, section 3.1 applies: standard list price less 'any discount agreed in an Order.' No pricing exception covers NS-EDGE. No order-level discount for NS-EDGE is documented.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales, EMP-200)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 customer agreement (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (in force on request date)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception: NS-500 only, max 15%)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-10 (prior exception: NS-500 only, max 10%)\",\n    \"Employee records: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive), Michael Torres (VP Sales)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review required: Establish Acme Manufacturing's contractual basis for a 12% discount on NS-EDGE. The active contract (ACME-MFG-2025) specifies this pricing for NS-500 only; NS-EDGE pricing is at standard list unless a separate agreement exists. Confirm whether an amendment, pricing exception, or new order agreement should apply.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Sales leadership\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5926,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5926},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"abd378db-8e32-45de-8f8b-4575a4e51f2e","uuid":"51d62535-315f-44d7-9306-223ee71ba587","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:01:26.719Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpev1xddRuqmZiHyTHVD"}
